- Symbol: APT
- Token Standard: Native Coin (Move Resource `0x1::aptos_coin::AptosCoin`) – bukan ERC-20/SPL
- Blockchain: Aptos (Mainnet)
- Contract Address: `0x1::aptos_coin::AptosCoin` (Framework address, native module)
- Decimals: 8
- Status: Live
