## Utility
- Utility: Gas / Fee Payment | Deskripsi: Diperlukan untuk membayar biaya transaksi (gas) di Aptos Mainnet. Fee dibakar (burned). | Status: Live | Sources: Aptos Docs Gas, https://aptos.dev/concepts/gas (HIGH)
- Utility: Staking / Validator Security | Deskripsi: Distake ke validator untuk berpartisipasi dalam Konsensus PoS (AptosBFT) dan memperoleh reward inflasi. Minimum stake untuk validator diputuskan governance. | Status: Live | Sources: Aptos Docs Staking, https://aptos.dev/concepts/staking (HIGH)
- Utility: Governance | Deskripsi: Token holder (atau delegasi ke validator) dapat voting pada AIP (Aptos Improvement Proposals) on-chain. 1 APT = 1 Vote. | Status: Live | Sources: Aptos Governance Framework, https://governance.aptoslabs.com/ (HIGH); AIP-1, https://github.com/aptos-foundation/AIPs/blob/main/AIPs/aip-1.md (HIGH)
- Utility: Validator Delegation | Deskripsi: Holder non-validator mendelegasikan stake ke validator untuk mendapatkan porsi reward (komisi validator berlaku). | Status: Live | Sources: Aptos Docs Staking, https://aptos.dev/concepts/staking (HIGH)
- Utility: Ecosystem Incentives / Grants | Deskripsi: Digunakan oleh Foundation untuk Grant, Hackathon, Liquidity Mining, User Acquisition (dari alokasi Community 51%). | Status: Live | Sources: Aptos Foundation Grants, https://aptosfoundation.org/grants (HIGH)
- Utility: Native Collateral (DeFi) | Deskripsi: Digunakan sebagai collateral di lending market (Aries, Thala), DEX liquidity pairs, Liquid Staking Tokens (Amnis, Thala). | Status: Live | Sources: DefiLlama Aptos, https://defillama.com/chain/Aptos (HIGH)
- Utility: Resource Account / Move Module Publishing | Deskripsi: Diperlukan untuk bayar storage rent / publish module Move on-chain (dalam biaya gas). | Status: Live | Sources: Aptos Move Book, https://aptos.dev/move/move-book/ (HIGH)

## Governance
- Governance Model: On-chain Token Voting (1 APT = 1 Vote) + Off-chain Discussion (Forum) -> On-chain Execution (Timelock)
- Voting System: Simple Majority / Quorum berdasarkan total stake yang voting. Proposal memerlukan quorum minimum (misal 1% supply) dan majority yes.
- Voting Power: APT yang di-stake (Self-stake + Delegated stake). Delegasi ke validator = validator mengeksekusi vote (kecuali delegator override).
- Delegation: Liquid Delegation (Bisa undelegate kapan saja, unbonding period ~0-30 hari tergantung proposal parameter, biasanya epoch boundary).
- Proposal System: AIP (Aptos Improvement Proposals) diajukan di GitHub/Forum -> Voting on-chain via `0x1::governance` module -> Eksekusi via Timelock (2 hari) jika lolos.
- Treasury Governance: Aptos Foundation (Legal Entity) mengelola Treasury (51% Community + 16.5% Endowment). Governance on-chain mengarah ke parameter protokol (inflation, gas, validator set), BUKAN pengeluaran Treasury Foundation langsung (Foundation off-chain legal entity).
- Status: Active
- Sources:
  - Sumber: Aptos Governance Forum, https://governance.aptoslabs.com/ (HIGH)
  - Sumber: AIP-1 Governance Parameters, https://github.com/aptos-foundation/AIPs/blob/main/AIPs/aip-1.md (HIGH)
  - Sumber: Aptos Whitepaper Governance Section, https://aptoslabs.com/whitepaper.pdf (HIGH)
  - Sumber: Foundation Legal Structure FAQ, https://aptosfoundation.org/ (MEDIUM)

## Inflation / Deflation
- Inflation Mechanism: Staking Rewards Emission. Tingkat inflasi awal 7% per tahun (applies ke total supply), menurun 1.5% per tahun hingga minimum 3.25% per tahun (Long-term target).
- Emission Schedule: Distribusi per epoch (2 jam) ke Validator & Staker pro-rata stake. Validator menerima komisi (fee) dari reward delegator.
- Burn Mechanism: 100% Base Gas Fee dibakar (burned) secara otomatis di protokol (di `0x1::aptos_coin` module). Priority tips ke validator (tidak dibakar).
- Buyback: Tidak ada mekanisme buyback protokol.
- Supply Reduction: Net Supply Change = Inflasi Emisi - Fee Burn. Deflationary jika Fee Burn > Emisi (belum tercapai konsisten).
- Status: Live
- Sources:
  - Sumber: Aptos Tokenomics Blog (Inflation Schedule Table), https://aptoslabs.com/aptos-tokenomics (HIGH)
  - Sumber: AIP-1 Inflation Parameters, https://github.com/aptos-foundation/AIPs/blob/main/AIPs/aip-1.md (HIGH)
  - Sumber: Aptos Whitepaper Economics, https://aptoslabs.com/whitepaper.pdf (HIGH)
  - Sumber: Aptos Framework Gas/Burn Code, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-core/blob/main/aptos-move/framework/aptos-framework/sources/aptos_coin.move (HIGH)

## Holder Distribution
- Top Holder Concentration: Foundation & Community Wallets (Multi-sig) memegang ~67.5% supply (Vested/Locked). Investor/Team ~32.5% (Vesting).
- Foundation Holding: ~165M APT (Endowment) + Sisa Community Reserve (Managed by Foundation Multi-sig). Alamat spesifik: `0x...foundation` (Multi-sig 0x1::governance resources).
- Investor Holding: ~134.8M APT (Vesting Monthly since Oct 2023). Terdistribusi ke ~30+ entity VC/Investor.
- Treasury Holding: Termasuk di Foundation Holding.
- Community Holding: ~20M Airdrop (Claimed), Sisa di Foundation untuk Grant. Circulating non-insider ~100M-200M estimasi.
- Whale Concentration: Tinggi (Top 10 wallets > 50% supply termasuk Foundation/Investor/Team vesting contracts).
